    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney's bring to the market this 3 bedroom residence situated within walking distance to a wealth of amenities and minutes walk to Limerick City. The accommodation comprises of front living-room with a new stove fireplace, dining-room/kitchen, 3 bedrooms and main bathroom. Outside raised decking area, garage wired & plumber enclosed yard. New roof to the whole of the property. A single gate leads from this yard to a communal passageway which services the property and neighbouring properties.  To the front large gated driveway. This property is in excellent condition and would be ideal for a young family, correct sizing or even as an investment opportunity. Viewing A Must. Age: Circa 1950's. Viewing is highly recommended. This location is second to none in this popular area, offering an unrivalled sense of convenience & all within a gentle stroll of a host of amenities. This mature residential & highly sought-after location is close to many primary & secondary schools, including the University of Limerick. An abundance of shops, restaurants, bars & sporting facilities. For those commuting further afield, the Ballysimon Road is only stone's throw from the motorway network surrounding Limerick, and the location also benefits from having many local bus routes to bring you to and from the city centre. Contact Peter Kearney at Rooney's on 061-413511, www.rooneys.eu"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room - 4.11 m x 3.41 m \r\nNewly fitted stove fireplace, wood floor, \r\n\r\nBedroom 1, 2.64m x 3.49m \r\nWood flooring, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2, 3.51m x 2.76m \r\nwood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3, 3.10 x 2.66m\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.03m x 3.98m \r\nFully Fitted kitchen with rear doored access to rear patio.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.78m x 2.47m, \r\nbath, WC, electric shower,\r\nTilled floor.\r\n\r\nGarage- 4.41m x 2.64m\r\nPlumbed for washing machine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features: \r\nRenovated in recent years.\r\nDouble-glazed windows throughout.\r\nNew roof to the whole of the property.\r\nShort walk to the central business and shopping district.\r\nRecent exterior wall insulation throughout.\r\nOff street parking for multiple vehicles.\r\nOozes location location location.\r\nA property with much character.\r\nIdeal family home, right sizer home or investment property."
      },
